==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|NL.|en}} {{m|la|incisor}}, from {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|incisus}} + {{m|la||-or}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|aɪzə(r)|lang=en}}
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/ɪnˈsaɪzə/|lang=en}}
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|/ɪnˈsaɪzəɹ/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# One of the front [[teeth]] of [[mammal]]s, between the [[canine]]s.

